            "paragraph": "Beyond the one-dimensional validation, the performance of the new convection scheme was assessed in global climate mode. The model used in the previous section is now considered in a three-dimensional global geometry. As mentioned, this model is called AC. Version 5 was used, based on the dynamical core of ARPEGE-IFS (cycle 32), IFS being the global model used at the European Centre for Medium-Range Weather Forecasts (ECMWF).",
