            "source_entity_type": "Source",
            "relation": "HAS_SOURCE_COMPONENT",
            "target_entity_instance": "NEMO",
            "target_entity_type": "SourceComponent",
            "paragraph": "A 20-yr coupled simulation was carried out in order to determine the climate of the model with the new set of parametrizations and to compare it to the observed climate. The ocean model was NEMO (Madec, 2008) in a 2\u00b0 horizontal resolution and 31 vertical levels. Sea ice is also taken into account in the present version of the ocean model.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": false,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
